  "id": "broccoli-slaw",
  "name": "Broccoli Slaw",
  "subtitle": "Crunchy broccoli slaw with sweet-tangy dressing",
  "description": "A crisp salad combining broccoli slaw, broken ramen noodles, nuts, raisins, onions, and peppers in a balanced oil-and-vinegar dressing.",
